Fibo-2 model integration
-----------------------
The native implementation is supplied by the Apache-2.0-licensed Diffusers
package, pinned in workers/image/requirements.txt. No Bria model weights,
bria-vgl code, or model repository executable code are vendored here.

Checkpoints are downloaded at runtime from gated upstream repositories:
https://huggingface.co/briaai/Fibo-2.0-dev
https://huggingface.co/briaai/Fibo-2.0-edit-turbo
Their upstream model access and license terms apply independently of this code.
The integration does not accept model access or license agreements automatically.

Runtime font downloads include their upstream notices:
fonts/LICENSE-Aileron.txt and fonts/LICENSE-DejaVu.txt.
